{"id":366,"name":"clamperl","speciesId":366,"dex":366,"form":"normal","generation":3,"types":["water"],"stats":{"hp":35,"attack":64,"defense":85,"special-attack":74,"special-defense":55,"speed":32},"abilities":[{"name":"shell-armor","hidden":false},{"name":"rattled","hidden":true}],"height":4,"weight":525,"baseExp":69,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/366.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/366.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/366.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/366.ogg","genus":"Bivalve Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"CLAMPERL’s sturdy shell is not only good for protection - it is also used for clamping and catching prey. A fully grown CLAMPERL’s shell will be scored with nicks and scratches all over."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"CLAMPERL grows while being protected by its rock-hard shell. When its body becomes too large to fit inside the shell, it is sure evidence that this POKéMON is getting close to evolution."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A CLAMPERL slams its shell closed on prey to prevent escape. The pearl it creates upon evolution is said to be infused with a mysterious energy."},{"version":"firered","text":"It is protected by a sturdy shell. Once in a lifetime, it makes a magnificent pearl."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"When it evolves, it makes a mysterious pearl that amplifies psychic powers when it’s held."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Clamperl’s sturdy shell is not only good for protection—it is also used for clamping and catching prey. A fully grown Clamperl’s shell will be scored with nicks and scratches all over."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire",